'''Gloom''' (Japanese: '''クサイハナ''' ''Kusaihana'') is a {{ct|Grass}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion.

