==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unbroken Bonds|Gloom|7}} from the {{TCG|Unbroken Bonds}} expansion.
**Both cards have the '''Drool''' attack, which first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Heroes|Erika's Weepinbell|48}} from the {{TCG|Gym Heroes}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

